    "Bake keeps the current masked appearance in the dependent layers’ pixels. Remove Links reveals their pixels. You can undo either choice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "烘焙会将当前蒙版效果写入依赖图层的像素。移除链接会显示这些图层的像素。两种操作均可撤销。"
          }
        }
