    "Text Editing": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text color": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text fields keep standard macOS editing keys. Dialogs share the Apply/Cancel assignments above. Numeric fields use Up/Down, with Shift for larger steps. Standard macOS commands include ⌘Q to quit and ⌃⌘F for full screen. The shortcut editor itself always uses Return to save and Esc to cancel when not recording.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本栏保留标准 macOS 编辑快捷键。对话框共用上方的应用/取消快捷键。数值栏可使用上/下方向键调整，按住 Shift 可增大步长。标准 macOS 命令包括 ⌘Q 退出和 ⌃⌘F 进入全屏。快捷键编辑器在未录制快捷键时始终使用 Return 保存、Esc 取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text-editing shortcuts need Command, Option, or Control so they do not replace normal typing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字编辑快捷键须包含 Command、Option 或 Control，以免影响正常输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That selection is too detailed to outline. Try a different Tolerance, or turn on Contiguous.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该选区过于精细，无法生成轮廓。请尝试其他容差值，或启用“连续”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That shape is too large. A shape can cover up to 100 megapixels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该形状过大。单个形状最多可覆盖 1 亿像素。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop file could not be read. It may be damaged or incomplete.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取 Photoshop 文件。文件可能已损坏或不完整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop stroke isn’t supported on shape layers and was omitted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "形状图层不支持此 Photoshop 描边，已忽略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The brush trails the pointer on a string this long, so a shaky hand still draws a smooth line": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画笔以此距离跟随指针，让手部抖动时也能画出平滑线条"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The canvas could not be rendered. Try a smaller canvas.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法渲染画布。请尝试较小的画布。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copied layers exceed this project’s 100-megapixel limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制的图层超过了此项目的 1 亿像素限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The image could not be encoded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法编码图像。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The image could not be read. It may be damaged or unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取图像。文件可能已损坏或不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The layer mask couldn’t be converted to 8-bit grayscale and was skipped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法将图层蒙版转换为 8 位灰度，已跳过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The object mask could not be rendered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法渲染对象蒙版。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The smart object was rasterized. Linked contents can’t be edited.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "智能对象已栅格化，无法编辑链接的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There isn’t enough memory to make that selection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内存不足，无法创建该选区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These layers supply live masks": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些图层提供实时蒙版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Layer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前图层"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Photoshop file uses a layer compression method that isn’t supported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Photoshop 文件使用了不受支持的图层压缩方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Photoshop layer type isn’t supported and was imported as pixels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持此 Photoshop 图层类型，已作为像素导入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This adjustment type isn’t supported and was skipped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持此调整类型，已跳过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This clipping mask’s base isn’t supported, so clipping was skipped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持此剪贴蒙版的底层，已跳过剪贴。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This import exceeds the current 100-megapixel document budget or 30,000-pixel side limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此次导入超过当前文档的 1 亿像素总量限制或单边 30,000 像素限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is not a valid Compositor project, or its metadata is damaged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这不是有效的 Compositor 项目，或其元数据已损坏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This layer supplies a live mask": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此图层提供实时蒙版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This project exceeds the supported canvas, layer, file-size, or 100-megapixel image limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此项目超过支持的画布、图层、文件大小或 1 亿像素限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This project uses format version %lld. This app supports versions 1–7.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此项目使用格式版本 %lld。本应用支持版本 1–7。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This project uses format version %lld. This app supports versions 1–8.": {
